WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.387 --> 00:00:06.231
Today's One Minute Monday is: "Be consistent."

00:00:06.231 --> 00:00:09.992
I recently got a message on YouTube from one of my long time viewers, Shuffz.

00:00:09.992 --> 00:00:11.122
Thank you, Shuffz!

00:00:11.122 --> 00:00:14.671
He wrote in to say: "Hey, I've been out for a while. Great to see that you're still doing this!"

00:00:14.671 --> 00:00:20.088
Every day I'm posting videos to my YouTube channel. Every single day new videos go up.

00:00:20.088 --> 00:00:23.958
You have to be consistent! This is the problem with a lot of entrepreneurs, ok?

00:00:23.958 --> 00:00:29.232
You start something and they you stop, you start, you stop, you start, you stop and never gain any momentum.

00:00:29.232 --> 00:00:35.426
You need to do something every single day to grow your business. Consistency is SO important!

00:00:35.426 --> 00:00:41.361
And I know you may only be a part-time entrepreneur, ok? You may have a job, you have other responsibilities.

00:00:41.361 --> 00:00:47.141
I'm not saying jump in and do it full time every day, but every single day, if it's 1/2 hour a day,

00:00:47.141 --> 00:00:53.345
... you're taking one action; you have to be consistent, because that's how you're going to grow your business.

00:00:53.345 --> 00:00:54.294
Believe!

00:00:54.294 --> 00:00:57.269
For those of you watching and liked the video, thumbs up below. Leave a comment.

00:00:57.269 --> 00:00:59.158
Click on my face, subscribe to the channel.

00:00:59.158 --> 00:01:00.565
I'll see you soon.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:08.000
